{"name": "Genome Guardian 2", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/4ded1bb1509c54a6a5c4a0e666400f9e.avif?t=1787950544\" width=\"779\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/aa2de96f93fdbe8ee7862824cc4de838.poster.avif?t=1787950544\" width=\"256\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/aa2de96f93fdbe8ee7862824cc4de838.webm?t=1787950544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/aa2de96f93fdbe8ee7862824cc4de838.mp4?t=1787950544\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/de9bd65d67086c442cb5959f02c094a3.poster.avif?t=1787950544\" width=\"256\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/de9bd65d67086c442cb5959f02c094a3.webm?t=1787950544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/93c0b81c2626212a50d31f4e15b09263.poster.avif?t=1787950544\" width=\"256\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/93c0b81c2626212a50d31f4e15b09263.webm?t=1787950544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/93c0b81c2626212a50d31f4e15b09263.mp4?t=1787950544\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dive back into the<strong> microscopic world, </strong>radiating with<strong> bioluminescent life </strong>and <strong>unspeakable horrors.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Research permanent upgrades to survive a variety of microbes &amp; modes in this massively expanded follow-up to Genome Guardian.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"128\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/9b5ee5c0a5822982b42e5176d1a00e0c.avif?t=1787950544\" width=\"779\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/47be3ad8134035b3381cd5580fe7f5ff.poster.avif?t=1787950544\" width=\"256\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/47be3ad8134035b3381cd5580fe7f5ff.webm?t=1787950544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/47be3ad8134035b3381cd5580fe7f5ff.mp4?t=1787950544\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"256\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/e2100c79b17be0e54b9729f0ad3cb9a7.poster.avif?t=1787950544\" width=\"256\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4130120/extras/e2100c79b17be0e54b9729f0ad3cb9a7.webm?t=1787950544\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=